      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If the user's group or pronouns are offensive, why would you not ban or kick them? Those are an indicator of future behavior.\n\nThere _may_ be other reasons to hide a group, though: for example, someone not on-duty staff is representing the staff group and is AFK. There is no reason for an instance moderator to be able to hide pronouns.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
