  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-05-23T21:18:29.262Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If a user enters a moderated instance with an offensive group or offensive pronouns, a moderator of that instance should be able to select the user and disable display of that user's group banner or pronouns, similar to how moderators can force a user's microphone off.  \n\nThere should not be a notification to the target user, as the purpose of this would be to allow moderation without confrontation.\n\nDisplay of the user's group and pronouns would resume upon them leaving the current instance.",
